{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sweet Defense is a game that mixes tower defense and strategy with deck building, set in a world full of living treats. Your mission is simple, but not easy: protect Mother Cake, the mother of all sweets, from relentless hordes of hungry animals such as bears, bees, and bizarre creatures that love sugar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cards to summon defenses and cook recipes with special abilities. Plan your strategy carefully: each match brings faster waves and tougher enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Unique blend of Tower Defense and deck building.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Creative, themed defenses inspired by desserts and treats.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Varied enemies with their own abilities and unique attack patterns.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3916480?t=1759173612","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916480/0d3dc1a9878398b5848004d14baa098c03c6b6e1/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759173612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916480/6014a1f091b39872ad11621313b2fae5f5eb1848/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759173612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3916480/6014a1f091b39872ad11621313b2fae5f5eb1848/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759173612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":51},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62},{"description":"Steam Timeline","id":63}],"content_descriptors":{"i